      "content": "thanks for that. i'm trying to get more specific for my paper though. when sociologists talk about the \"character\" of a neighborhood changing during this process, how do they usually describe the vibe of the new community vs the old one? like, is there a difference in how the incoming residents are characterized in terms of their contribution to the area compared to the folks who were there before?",
